* Swap Minneapolis for Reykjavík (`64.15°N`) — watch the midnight sun produce
  no rise/set events for the Sun in June.
* See [`getting_started.livemd`](../getting_started.livemd) for single-instant
  `observe/4` and multi-city fan-out.
